WEBVTT

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:11.110
So the legendary warrior, Precure, lies defeated.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:14.160
With this, the Great Heart Tree shall wither,

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.780
and the world shall belong to us, the Desert Apostles!

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.820
The flowers have fallen, so why has the tree not yet wilted?

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.900
Seems your luck has run out.

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.650
Even if I fall,

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:34.840
other Precure shall appear before you to protect the Great Heart Tree!

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.640
Dark Forte Wave!

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.480
Cure Moonlight!

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.700
Chypre! Coffret!

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.930
Pass the Heart Perfume onto the next Precure!

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:53.820
Out of the way!

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:58.780
My fairies... seek out my replacement!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:19.990
{OP}

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.180
HeartCatch

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:24.640
Precure!

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.180
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:31.190
Now, all together

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:33.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.660
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:44.280
Within each of our chests,

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.950
they begin to sprout

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.580
The seeds of the heart

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:49.870
are growing

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.500
bit by bit

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:53.170
Red,

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:53.790
white

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.080
and yellow

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:57.880
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:58.090 --> 00:01:59.300
all varied colors

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:00.760
that they

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:02.920
shine so brightly!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:08.260
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.770
with such care

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:13.480
will never wither

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.060
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.940
Now, all together

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:22.400
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:25.070
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:29.950
They're always right by our sides

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:30.790
So together

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:34.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:37.620
bloom even more!

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:39.120
HeartCatch

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.630
Precure!

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.810
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:56.460
I know it's my turn to cook on Saturday.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:57.740
Good morning, Yuri.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.990
I woke up early this morning, so don't worry about it.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.500
Let's eat.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:22.780
What's the matter?

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:25.500
Mom.

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:30.350
Can't you stop laying dad's place at the table already?

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:31.850
Why?

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:37.820
It's been three years since he left to go looking for the Great Heart Tree, you know?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.610
Dad was always so considerate.

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:42.130
If he hasn't contacted us at all in three whole years,

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:44.200
he must already be...

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.490
Your father will be all right.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:49.290
How can you be so sure?

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:51.710
I can just tell these things.

00:03:56.230 --> 00:04:00.000
It's hard not to be convinced 
when you say it like that, Mom.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.630
Nobody's a match for your persuasion. {No-one to nobody.}

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:08.420
I'll be off, then.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:09.550
Take care, all right?

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.530
I have to put on such a brave face.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:32.040
The Truth is Revealed<i>!</i>

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:32.040
The Truth is Revealed<i>!</i>

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:54.730
Cure Moonlight...

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.930
What's the matter?

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.770
Cure Moonlight...

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:01.740
cannot possibly still be alive!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:07.040
You saw her final moments for yourself, did you not?

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.350
It's a Seed of the Precure.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:39.060
Even if she's still alive, as long as we hold her Seed of the Precure,

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:42.760
she will never be able to become a Precure again.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:48.990
For now, you should concern yourself with defeating the Precure who stand against us, all right?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:49.790
Okay.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.630
Do not concern yourself with Cure Moonlight.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.010
I'll be leaving now!

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:09.470
Good morning! Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:10.930
Good morning!

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:15.390
Thank you very much for inviting me out to shop today!

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:18.480
It wasn't a bother on such short notice?

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:19.900
Not in the least!

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.990
Stop it with the greetings already! Let's get going!

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:29.030
Momo's always so darn impulsive. {agftaweafahaha STOP IT ;.;}

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:35.610
The only reason she invited us today is because she got time off work and needed a way to waste it.

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:42.340
Still, I'm really happy I get to go shopping with a charismatic model like Momoka!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:45.380
You're such a kind and honest girl, Tsubomi.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:49.330
Hey, cut that out! Tsubomi is <i>my</i> best friend! {Any reason you include the honorific here? Does Erika not normally use it?}

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.230
Oh, that reminds me.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.870
While we're here, I guess I should invite my best friend as well.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:59.480
Your best friend? Who's that?

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:04.440
Hello?

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:08.180
It's not often that you're the one calling me, Momoka. {ringing -> calling. It's just very British.}

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:09.860
Okay.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:10.870
Right.

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.560
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:14.910
There's somewhere I have to be right now,

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.290
so I really can't. Sorry.

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:18.050
Later, then.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.670
She turned me down!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:25.540
I can't believe anyone would turn down an 
invite from a charismatic model like Momoka.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:29.330
Well, if she turned you down, I have
 a feeling we'd get along pretty well. {on -> along}

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.540
What was that?!

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:32.510
It was a joke, jeez!

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:33.970
Now, now.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.390
We can have fun with just the three of us.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:39.250
Oh?

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.750
Excuse me a second.

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:43.120
It's from Grandma!

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:45.220
Hello, Grandma?

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:47.690
What?! The desert agave is blooming?!

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.650
Yes! Yes!

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.650
Desert agave?

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:51.110
I'll be right there!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.920
Momoka, Erika, I'm really sorry!

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:58.510
It seems a desert agave is going to bloom at the botanical gardens, and they only bloom once in decades!

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.610
I'm going to hurry over and take a look!

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:01.480
Bye! {Added the comma. I know what you were intending, but it just doesn't work in this format.}

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.660
Unless you'd like to come take a look too?

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:10.560
Don't worry about us. You go have fun, all right?

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:11.250
Right!

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.920
Well, if that's how it's gonna be, the two of us should get a move on.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:17.150
Right, big sis?

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:18.390
You're creeping me out!

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.390
Someone's coming!

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:25.690
We need to hide!

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.160
Lord Coupe...

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:43.460
Yuri!

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:46.920
It's been a while.

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:50.380
How have you been holding up?

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:56.260
That reminds me!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.720
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:00.430
Of me?

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.000
Well, the thing is...

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:07.330
My granddaughter Tsubomi and her best friend Erika have become the new Precures,

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.690
and are fighting against the Desert Apostles.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:13.870
You know of them, right?

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:14.520
Yes.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:18.190
Then that makes things simple.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:23.540
I think you'll be able to give them the advice they need, Yuri.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:30.160
So your heart hasn't yet healed from the damage it took back then?

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.550
The once-in-decades opportunity!

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.180
That was quick.

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:38.360
You said that the aga—

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.140
Huh?

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.520
Aren't you...

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:46.860
You know what the geranium means in the language of flowers, I take it?

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:47.730
Yes!

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:50.940
If I recall correctly, it means "true friendship."

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.920
That's just like us, isn't it?

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:55.900
I wonder.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:59.820
I don't think you understand what that really means.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:07.840
Thanks to the advice you gave us back then, we were able to help our dear friends!

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:10.170
Thank you so much!

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:11.780
I didn't really do anything...

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:13.170
Is that so?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.820
Really, I didn't!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.320
I just told her what the flower meant, that's all!

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:19.010
Well then, if you'll excuse me.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.940
Hold on a minute, Yuri.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:23.090
A desert agave is about to bloom.

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:24.140
Wouldn't you like to see it with us?

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.180
A desert agave?

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.520
Help!

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:34.980
What's the matter?!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:37.240
These weird creeps are running wild at the station!

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.110
Weird creeps?

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:53.880
Dark Precure!

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:13.770
So this is what a desert agave's flower is like.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:14.900
It's beautiful.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:21.360
I've been raising it since I started my research here at the botanical gardens, and it's finally bloomed.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:24.410
This is the first one I've ever seen.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:28.000
So you're interested in flowers too?

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:30.480
It's not a case of mere interest with her!

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:33.830
When she was young, she used to come and visit every day.

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.760
Yeah. Well...

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:47.190
Erika, what's the matter?

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:49.310
Huh? The station's being attacked by Dark—

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:50.430
<i>At the station?</i>

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:54.890
Yuri!

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:59.070
Yuri's mother works as a shopkeeper at the station!

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:00.310
What?!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.910
Momo, hurry and run!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.180
Huh?! What are you—

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:25.600
Mom!

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:26.500
Yuri?!

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:27.600
Hurry and get out of here!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.240
Amazing...

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.040
Erika!

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:55.040
Tsubomi!

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.410
Let's transform!

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:58.000
Right!

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:11.750
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.000
Precure!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.600
Open My Heart!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:05.390
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:10.610
Cure Blossom!

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:16.050
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:20.750
Cure Marine!

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.050
HeartCatch Precure!

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:37.450
I did not let the Snackies loose just to draw you two out.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.540
Now the pests are out of the way.

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:55.080
Why are you so obsessed with me?!

00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:01.060
Because you...

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:04.130
Because you are me!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:06.090
Cure Moonlight!

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:08.520
Yuri is...

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.750
...Cure Moonlight?!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.180
There only needs to be one me!

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:17.200
So I shall eliminate you.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.240
Yuri!

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.530
You again?!

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:55.760
Everyone!

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:57.890
Use this chance to escape!

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:24.580
There's no point in running.

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:25.920
As long as I have this,

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:28.950
you cannot escape me, Cure Moonlight.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:38.760
Just who is that pretty guy who keeps saving us?

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.730
Well, we know he's not an enemy, at least.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.690
I sense Dark Precure's presence approaching us!

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:49.150
As long as we have Coupe's barrier, she won't find us.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.150
But she's definitely heading straight for us! {Removed comma.}

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:55.110
It's probably... because of this.

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:56.950
That's...

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.550
A Seed of the Precure?!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:04.000
It'd be really bad if Dark Precure found out about this place!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.210
We have to stop her before she gets here!

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:07.650
Got it!

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:10.880
Yuri, please take care of Lord Coupe and Grandma!

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:19.330
She's close...

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:28.030
Precures?!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.360
We won't let you go any further!

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:35.920
Out of my way.

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:00.990
Dark Power, Gather!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.220
Dark Tact!

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:07.610
Precure Dark Power Fortissimo!

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:12.650
We'll protect Yuri, no matter what!

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:24.040
Gather, Floral Power!

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:27.710
Blossom Tact!

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:31.130
Marine Tact!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:38.770
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:44.320
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.890
Stop, Dark Precure!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:30.800
Didn't I tell you not to concern yourself with Cure Moonlight?

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:32.390
Return to me at once.

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:34.410
Very well.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.280
Luck favors you this day.

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:54.460
Who was that voice that called back Dark Precure?

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:58.630
It was probably the boss of the Desert Apostles, Sabark.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:01.880
So it's not just Sasorina and the other commanders...

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:07.210
But I never would've imagined that you were Cure Moonlight, Yuri!

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:08.140
That shocked me!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:15.950
Yuri, please help us to fight the Desert Apostles!

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:17.360
We're begging you!

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:22.640
Yuri?

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:26.210
I cannot fight alongside you.

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:30.100
My mother is probably worried about me, so...

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.080
Yuri!

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.780
Just leave her alone for the moment, all right?

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:37.750
Grandma?

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:42.830
The damage that Sabark and Dark Precure inflicted on her heart has not yet healed.

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:47.440
And since she lost her Seed of the Precure, Yuri...

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:50.720
can't become Cure Moonlight anymore.

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:01.930
Yuri!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.860
I was so worried about you!

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:14.290
When I went back to the station, you weren't there, so I searched and searched, but...

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:15.710
Sorry for worrying you.

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:18.680
There's no need to apologize.

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:22.170
I just wanted to make sure you were all right.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:22.960
Yeah.

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:35.520
Will she really never be able to become a Precure again?

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:39.350
You saw for yourself in your dream.

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:44.570
Cure Moonlight fought with her all to protect the Great Heart Tree.

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:47.540
And now that wish has been 
passed on to the both of you.

00:21:47.540 --> 00:21:50.030
We'll have to fight for Cure Moonlight!

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:54.110
Right!

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:09.920
{ED}

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.810
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:21.730
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.650
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.950 --> 00:22:27.610
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:36.160
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:39.120
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:42.290
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.750
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.720
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:53.720
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:56.560
is about to begin!

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:59.770
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:02.690
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.610
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.150
We're pretty

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:08.950
at full bloom!

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:12.070
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:15.120
until it shines

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:16.660
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:20.910
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.920
So don't sulk

